748494811,\"author\":{\"uid\":970788,\"avatar\":\"https:\\/\\/cdn.luogu.com.cn\\/upload\\/usericon\\/970788.png\",\"name\":\"chestnut_emperor\",\"slogan\":\"\\u539f\\u540d__DYL__|U688855|\\u6740\\u5173\\u4e86qwp\\uff0c\\u53ef\\u4ee5\\u627e\\u6211\\u79c1\\u4fe1\\u8981\\u56de\\u6765\",\"badge\":null,\"isAdmin\":false,\"isBanned\":false,\"color\":\"Blue\",\"ccfLevel\":0,\"xcpcLevel\":0,\"background\":\"https:\\/\\/cdn.luogu.com.cn\\/upload\\/image_hosting\\/nxpew99d.png\"},\"upvote\":0,\"replyCount\":0,\"favorCount\":0,\"status\":2,\"solutionFor\":{\"pid\":\"P1428\",\"type\":\"P\",\"name\":\"\\u5c0f\\u9c7c\\u6bd4\\u53ef\\u7231\",\"difficulty\":1,\"fullScore\":100},\"promoteStatus\":3,\"collection\":null,\"content\":\"# [\\u539f\\u9898P1428](https:\\/\\/www.luogu.com.cn\\/problem\\/P1428)\\n\\n## \\u601d\\u8def\\n\\u6211\\u4eec\\u770b\\u4e00\\u4e0b\\uff0c $n$ \\u7684\\u8303\\u56f4\\u662f $1$~$100$\\uff0c\\u8003\\u8651 $n\\\\times n$ \\u7684\\u65f6\\u95f4\\u590d\\u6742\\u5ea6\\uff0c\\u4e8e\\u662f\\u4e4e\\uff0c\\u65f6\\u95f4\\u590d\\u6742\\u5ea6\\u4e3a $O(n^2)$\\uff0c\\u53cc\\u91cd\\u5faa\\u73af\\u5b8c\\u5168\\u53ef\\u884c\\uff08\\u800c $a_i$ \\u4e0d\\u5927\\u4e8e\\u65f6\\uff0c\\u6574\\u6570\\u578b\\u53d8\\u91cf\\u4e5f\\u5b8c\\u5168\\u641e\\u5b9a\\uff09\\u3002\\n\\u7ec6\\u8bf4\\u4e00\\u4e0b\\u54c8\\uff1a\\u5148\\u679a\\u4e3e\\n\\n\\n**AC code\\uff1a**\\n```\\n#include\\u003Cbits\\/stdc++.h\\u003E\\nusing namespace std;\\nint n,a[3010],sum=0;\\nint main(){\\n    cin\\u003E\\u003En;\\n    for(int i=1;i\\u003C=n;i++)cin\\u003E\\u003Ea[i];\\/\\/\\u8f93\\u5165\\u8f93\\u51fa\\u4e0d\\u7528\\u8bb2\\u5427\\u3002\\n    for(int i=1;i\\u003C=n;i++)\\n    {\\n        for(int j=i-1;j\\u003E=1;j--)\\/\\/\\u5d4c\\u5957\\u3002\\n        {\\n            if(a[i]\\u003Ea[j])sum++;\\/\\/\\u4e0d\\u5982\\u81ea\\u5df1\\u53ef\\u7231\\u7684\\u6570\\u91cf+1\\u3002\\n        }\\n        cout\\u003C\\u003Csum\\u003C\\u003C\\u0027 \\u0027;\\n        sum=0;\\/\\/\\u6ce8\\u610f\\u5f52\\u96f6\\u3002\\n    }\\n    \\n    return 0;\\/\\/\\u5b8c\\u7ed3\\u6492\\u82b1\\u3002\\n}\\n```\",\"contentFull\":true,\"adminNote\":null},\"favored\":false,\"voted\":null,\"canReply\":false,\"canEdit\":false},\"user\":null,\"time\":1795629611.908586}</script>            <script src=\"https://fecdn.luogu.com.cn/columba/loader.20261113-2335.js\" charset=\"utf-8\" defer></script>\n    <link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"https://fecdn.luogu.com.cn/columba/loader.20261113-2335.css\" />\n    <script src=\"https://fecdn.luogu.com.cn/columba/vendor.20261113-2335.js\" charset=\"utf-8\" defer></script>\n        <link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https://www.luogu.com/article/2edysvbn\" />\n    <script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\":\"https:\\/\\/schema.org\",\"@type\":\"Article\",\"name\":\"\\u9898\\u89e3\\uff1aP1428 \\u5c0f\\u9c7c\\u6bd4\\u53ef\\u7231\",\"description\":\"\\u539f\\u9898P1428\\n\\u601d\\u8def\\n\\u6211\\u4eec\\u770b\\u4e00\\u4e0b\\uff0c n \\u7684\\u8303\\u56f4\\u662f 1~100\\uff0c\\u8003\\u8651 n\\\\times n \\u7684\\u65f6\\u95f4\\u590d\\u6742\\u5ea6\\uff0c\\u4e8e\\u662f\\u4e4e\\uff0c\\u65f6\\u95f4\\u590d\\u6742\\u5ea6\\u4e3a O(n^2)\\uff0c\\u53cc\\u91cd\\u5faa\\u73af\\u5b8c\\u5168\\u53ef\\u884c\\uff08\\u800c a_i \\u4e0d\\u5927\\u4e8e\\u65f6\\uff0c\\u6574\\u6570\\u578b\\u53d8\\u91cf\\u4e5f\\u5b8c\\u5168\\u641e\\u5b9a\\uff09\\u3002\\n\\u7ec6\\u8bf4\\u4e00\\u4e0b\\u54c8\\uff1a\\u5148\\u679a\\u4e3e\\nAC code\\uff1a\\u2026\",\"genre\":\"\\u9898\\u89e3\",\"author\":{\"@type\":\"Person\",\"name\":\"chestnut_emperor\"},\"datePublished\":\"2025-05-29T13:00:11+08:00\"}</script>\n    <meta property=\"og:type\" content=\"article\" />\n    <meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"题解：P1428 小鱼比可爱\" />\n    <meta property=\"og:description\" content=\"原题P1428\n思路\n我们看一下， n 的范围是 1~100，考虑 n\\times n 的时间复杂度，于是乎，时间复杂度为 O(n^2)，双重循环完全可行（而 a_i 不大于时，整数型变量也完全搞定）。\n细说一下哈：先枚举\nAC code：…\" />\n    <meta property=\"article:section\" content=\"题解\" />\n    <meta property=\"article:author\" content=\"chestnut_emperor\" />\n    <meta property=\"article:published_time\" content=\"2025-05-29T13:00:11+08:00\" />\n    <meta property=\"og:url\" content=\"https://www.luogu.com/article/2edysvbn\" />\n    <meta property=\"og:site_name\" content=\"洛谷专栏\" />\n        <script id=\"luogu-theme\" type=\"application/json\">{\"id\":1,\"lNavi\":{\"back\":\"#ffffff\",\"fore\":\"#262626\",\"logo\":null},\"lBody\":{\"back\":\"#f0f4fa\",\"blur\":1000,\"fade\":1000,\"image\":\"https:\\/\\/cdn.luogu.com.cn\\/images\\/bg\\/fe\\/luogu4-bg-l.jpg\",\"midOpts\":{\"size\":\"cover\"}},\"dNavi\":{\"back\":\"#1d2025\",\"fore\":\"#ffffff\",\"logo\":\"#ffffff\"},\"dBody\":{\"back\":\"#0d1018\",\"blur\":1000,\"fade\":1000,\"image\":\"https:\\/\\/cdn.luogu.com.cn\\/images\\/bg\\/fe\\/luogu4-bg-d.jpg\",\"midOpts\":{\"size\":\"cover\"}}}</script>\n    <style></style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<div id=\"app\">\n    <noscript>\n        <h3>请<b style=\"color:#f00;\">不要禁用</b>脚本，否则网页无法正常加载</h3>\n    </noscript>\n        <article>\n        <h1>题解：P1428 小鱼比可爱</h1>\n        <p style=\"font-size: .75em;\">\n            <a rel=\"author\">chestnut_emperor</a>\n            ·\n            <time datetime=\"2025-05-29T13:00:11+08:00\">2025-05-29 13:00:11</time>\n            ·\n            <a href=\"/article?category=2\">题解</a>\n        </p>\n\n        <h1>原题P1428</h1>\n<h2>思路</h2>\n<p>我们看一下， <la-tex display=\"inline\">n</la-tex> 的范围是 <la-tex display=\"inline\">1</la-tex>~<la-tex display=\"inline\">100</la-tex>，考虑 <la-tex display=\"inline\">n\\times n</la-tex> 的时间复杂度，于是乎，时间复杂度为 <la-tex display=\"inline\">O(n^2)</la-tex>，双重循环完全可行（而 <la-tex display=\"inline\">a_i</la-tex> 不大于时，整数型变量也完全搞定）。\n细说一下哈：先枚举</p>\n<p><strong>AC code：</strong></p>\n<pre><code>#include&lt;bits/stdc++.h&gt;\nusing namespace std;\nint n,a[3010],sum=0;\nint main(){\n    cin&gt;&gt;n;\n    for(int i=1;i&lt;=n;i++)cin&gt;&gt;a[i];//输入输出不用讲吧。\n    for(int i=1;i&lt;=n;i++)\n    {\n        for(int j=i-1;j&gt;=1;j--)//嵌套。\n        {\n            if(a[i]&gt;a[j])sum++;//不如自己可爱的数量+1。\n        }\n        cout&lt;&lt;sum&lt;&lt;' ';\n        sum=0;//注意归零。\n    }\n\n    return 0;//完结撒花。\n}</code></pre>\n    </article>\n</div>\n<script>(function(){function c(){var b=a.contentDocument||(a.contentWindow&&a.contentWindow.document);if(b){var d=b.createElement('script');d.innerHTML=\"window.__CF$cv$params={r:'a6028d316b16cf1b',t:'MTc5NTYyOTYxMQ=='};var l=window.parent.location,o;try{o=new URL(l.origin).origin}catch(e){try{o=new URL(new URL(l.href).origin).origin}catch(e){o=''}}var u='/cdn-cgi/challenge-platform/scripts/jsd/main.js?ray=a6028d316b16cf1b',a=document.createElement('script');a.src=o?new URL(u,o).href:u;document.getElementsByTagName('head')[0].appendChild(a);\";b.getElementsByTagName('head')[0].appendChild(d)}}if(document.body){var a=document.createElement('iframe');a.height=1;a.width=1;a.style.position='absolute';a.style.top=0;a.style.left=0;a.style.border='none';a.style.visibility='hidden';document.body.appendChild(a);if('loading'!==document.readyState)c();else if(window.addEventListener)document.addEventListener('DOMContentLoaded',c);else{var e=document.onreadystatechange||function(){};document.onreadystatechange=function(b){e(b);'loading'!==document.readyState&&(document.onreadystatechange=e,c())}}}})();</script></body>\n</html>\n",
